    {
      "is": "IS 10124 (Part 12):1988",
      "clause": "4",
      "title": "Marking",
      "text": "4. Marking —The bend shall be marked in colour as indicated below for different class of fittings: Class of Fitting               Colour Class 2 (0.4 MPa) Blue Class 3 (0.6 MPa) Green Class 4 (1.0 MPA) Yellow Note 1- For 0.25 MPa pressure class, fabricated bends should not be made from 0.25 MPa pressure class pipes.For this, bends made from 0.4 MPa pressure class pipe should be used. Note 2 - Y is calculated from × 2 π r, where r, radius of the bend is equal to 3 times the nominal outside diameter (D) For detailed information, refer to IS  10124 (Part 12) : 1988  Specification for  fabricated PVC fittings for potable water supplies  Part 12 Specific requirements for 22½ o bends. (first revision). FIG. 1  220-30' BEND o o 360 2 1 22",
